---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="SMS Messaging Policy — Preston East Solutions"
  description="How Preston East Solutions LLC uses SMS to confirm bookings and send appointment reminders. Opt-in, opt-out, message frequency, and carrier disclosures."
>
  <PageHeader label="Legal" title="SMS Messaging Policy" />
  <LegalLayout lastUpdated="June 2026">
    <p>
      This SMS Messaging Policy describes how <strong>Preston East Solutions LLC</strong>
      (“Preston East,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) uses text messaging to communicate
      with prospects and clients of
      <a href="https://prestoneastsolutions.com">prestoneastsolutions.com</a>.
      By providing your mobile phone number and checking the SMS consent box on
      our forms, you agree to the terms below.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Program description</h2>
    <p>Preston East sends transactional SMS messages tied to your interaction
    with us. There are two message types:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Booking confirmations and reminders</strong> — when you book a
      Free IT Health Check or an IT Roadmap Scoping Call, we send a confirmation
      and up to two reminders (24 hours before and 1 hour before).</li>
      <li><strong>Direct replies</strong> — if you text our number, our team may
      reply to continue the conversation. No automated marketing campaigns are
      sent.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How you opt in</h2>
    <p>You opt in to receive SMS by:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Checking the SMS consent box on our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>
      or <a href="/health-check">Health Check intake form</a>, or</li>
      <li>Booking an appointment through our online calendar and providing a
      mobile number with the booking.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Consent is not a condition of receiving any service. You can request
    a Health Check, contact us, or book a call without opting in to SMS — we
    will reach you by email or phone instead.</p>

    <h2>3. Message frequency</h2>
    <p>Expect <strong>up to 4 messages per appointment</strong> (confirmation,
    24-hour reminder, 1-hour reminder, and follow-up if applicable). Outside
    of active bookings or direct replies, you will not receive SMS from us.</p>

    <h2>4. How to opt out</h2>
    <p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message at any time to unsubscribe.
    You will receive a single confirmation that you have been unsubscribed,
    and we will not send further SMS to that number unless you opt in again.</p>
    <p>You can also email
    <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
    to request removal from SMS lists.</p>

    <h2>5. Help</h2>
    <p>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for help, or contact us at
    <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
    or <a href="tel:+14432183731">(443) 218-3731</a>.</p>

    <h2>6. Carriers and fees</h2>
    <p>Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier
    and plan. Preston East does not charge for SMS, but your carrier may.
    Supported carriers include all major U.S. carriers (AT&amp;T, Verizon,
    T-Mobile, U.S. Cellular, and others). Carriers are not liable for delayed
    or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2>7. Privacy</h2>
    <p>We treat your mobile number under the same terms as the rest of your
    information. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for full
    details on collection, use, sharing, and retention. We do not share or
    sell mobile numbers with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date
    at the top reflects the most recent change. Material changes will be
    communicated via the contact information you have provided.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this SMS policy:</p>
    <p>
      Preston East Solutions LLC<br />
      1125 West St, Ste 200 #335, Annapolis, MD 21401<br />
      <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a><br />
      <a href="tel:+14432183731">(443) 218-3731</a>
    </p>
  </LegalLayout>
</Layout>
